{"lemma":"אַשּׁוּר","translit":"ash.shur","gloss":"Asshur","tbesh_subentries":[],"tbesh_html":"A man living at the time of the Patriarchs, first mentioned at Gen.10.22; <br> son of: Shem (H8035); <br> brother of: Elam (H5867C), Arpachshad (H0775), Lud (H3865) and Aram (H0758)<BR> § Asshur or Assyria = \"a step\"<br>1) the second son of Shem, eponymous ancestor of the Assyrians<br>2) the people of Assyria<br>3) the nation, Assyria<br>4) the land, Assyria or Asshur","tbesh_key":"H0804","strongs_1890":{"strongs_def":"Ashshur, the second son of Shem; also his descendants and the country occupied by them (i.e. Assyria), its region and its empire","derivation":"or אַשֻּׁר; apparently from H833 (אָשַׁר) (in the sense of successful);","kjv_def":"Asshur, Assur, Assyria, Assyrians. See H838 (אָשֻׁר)."},"count":151,"occurrences":[["Gen.2.14",1,null,null],["Gen.10.11",1,null,null],["Gen.10.22",1,null,null],["Gen.25.18",1,null,null],["Num.24.22",1,null,null],["Num.24.24",1,null,null],["2Ki.15.19",1,null,null],["2Ki.15.20",2,null,null],["2Ki.15.29",2,null,null],["2Ki.16.7",1,null,null],["2Ki.16.8",1,null,null],["2Ki.16.9",2,null,null],["2Ki.16.10",1,null,null],["2Ki.16.18",1,null,null],["2Ki.17.3",1,null,null],["2Ki.17.4",3,null,null],["2Ki.17.5",1,null,null],["2Ki.17.6",2,null,null],["2Ki.17.23",1,null,null],["2Ki.17.24",1,null,null],["2Ki.17.26",1,null,null],["2Ki.17.27",1,null,null],["2Ki.18.7",1,null,null],["2Ki.18.9",1,null,null],["2Ki.18.11",2,null,null],["2Ki.18.13",1,null,null],["2Ki.18.14",2,null,null],["2Ki.18.16",1,null,null],["2Ki.18.17",1,null,null],["2Ki.18.19",1,null,null],["2Ki.18.23",1,null,null],["2Ki.18.28",1,null,null],["2Ki.18.30",1,null,null],["2Ki.18.31",1,null,null],["2Ki.18.33",1,null,null],["2Ki.19.4",1,null,null],["2Ki.19.6",1,null,null],["2Ki.19.8",1,null,null],["2Ki.19.10",1,null,null],["2Ki.19.11",1,null,null],["2Ki.19.17",1,null,null],["2Ki.19.20",1,null,null],["2Ki.19.32",1,null,null],["2Ki.19.35",1,null,null],["2Ki.19.36",1,null,null],["2Ki.20.6",